<mxCell id="p0_t0" value="Publish is owner-triggered; shipping and image-provider have published in this epoch. 6 ECR repositories exist (astroshop/checkout, shipping, quote, frontend-proxy, image-provider) plus platform/opentelemetry-collector; per-service digest evidence exists, fleet-wide publication does not." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#5A6672;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="404" y="334" width="320" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0_t1" value="The same immutable digest moves between environment roles. Promotion is a Git change that Argo CD reconciles; it is not a rebuild." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#1B2733;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="586" width="320" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0_t2" value="ADR-0009 states its implementation is not complete until one validated rollback exercise has run. That exercise has not run, so promotion, cross-environment promotion and rollback all remain open claims." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5A6672;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="626" width="320" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
